        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A hydroxy steroid that consists of 5beta-cardanolide having a double bond at the 20(22)-position as well as hydroxy groups at the 3beta-, 12beta- and 14beta-positions. It has been isolated from the plant species of the genus Digitalis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
