        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The appearance of a chemokine due to biosynthesis or secretion following a cellular stimulus, resulting in an increase in its intracellular or extracellular levels.</obo:IAO_0000115>
