        <obo:IAO_0000112 xml:lang="en">The section labelled &apos;availability and requirements&apos; in a typical scientific journal article, e.g. Qi et al. BMC Bioinformatics. 2014; 15: 11. (http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC3897912/).</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A part of a document about a resource described in the document, e.g. software, that describes the requirements necessary to use the resource, e.g. operating systems, hardware, etc. in the case of a software resource.</obo:IAO_0000115>
