        <obo:IAO_0000111 xml:lang="en">requirements textual entity</obo:IAO_0000111>
        <obo:IAO_0000112 xml:lang="en">From Qi et al. BMC Bioinformatics. 2014; 15: 11. (http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC3897912/):

• Operating systems: Platform independent

• Programming language: Matlab, R, Python

• Other requirements: None

• License: GNU GPL v3

• Any restrictions to use by non-academics: None</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A textual entity that expresses the requirements necessary to use a resource, e.g. software.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117 xml:lang="en">PERSON: Bill Baumgartner</obo:IAO_0000117>
