        <obo:IAO_0000116 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">changed from a role to a processed material based on on Aug 22, 2011 dev call. Details see the tracker item: http://sourceforge.net/tracker/?func=detail&amp;aid=3325270&amp;group_id=177891&amp;atid=886178
