Diagn Cytopathol. 2008 Oct 16. PMID: 18925569</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000114 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000120"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">a needle is a sharp, hollow device used to penetrate tissue or soft material. When attached to a syringe. it allows delivery of a specific volume of liquid or gaseous mixture.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Philippe Rocca-Serra</obo:IAO_0000117>
