        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A cloning plasmid is a plasmid that was engineered to contain a bacterial origin of replication, encodes for a selectable gene product and contains a cloning site.</obo:IAO_0000115>
