        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A nucleic acid digest is a material that is the output of a process in which nucleic acids are combined with a restriction enzyme resulting in digested fragments with defined ends based on the enzymes cleavage site</obo:IAO_0000115>
