        <obo:IAO_0000111 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">measuring neural activity in the caudate nucleus</obo:IAO_0000111>
        <obo:IAO_0000112 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An SU micro-electrode was used to measure neural activity in the form of spike trains in the caudate nucleus of monkeys in response to a flashing light stimulus</obo:IAO_0000112>
