        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A 3D structure determination assay in which the diffraction of pattern of X-ray beams in a crystal of purified material entities is used to resolve the 3-dimensional structure of the material entity of interest.</obo:IAO_0000115>
