        <obo:IAO_0000116 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">obsolete during the San Diego workshop, March 2011
The reason is that we decided to pursue a different modeling approach for services keeping just the &apos;service consumer&apos; and &apos;service provider&apos; roles and differentiate just at the level of planned process offered a s service.</obo:IAO_0000116>
