        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A measurement datum which is the result of combining multiple datum. For example, a mean or summary score.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">JT:  We included this because we wanted to talk about an output from a questionnaire that summarized the answers to the questionnaire, but which was not actually the answer to any single question.</obo:IAO_0000116>
