        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A stabilization function is a function that holds or isolates an entity such as an instrument or specimen steadfast or at an unfluctuating level or quantity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
