        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A device for dropping and immobilizing a solution of biomolecules, for example, nucleic acids such as probe DNA, mRNA, and peptide nucleic acid (PNA), and proteins on a DNA microarray surface to manufacture a DNA microarray.</obo:IAO_0000115>
