        <obo:IAO_0000112 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Determination of a 3D structure of an antibody binding a protein by X-Ray crystallography, which identifies the specific binding site of the antibody.</obo:IAO_0000112>
