        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A study design that aims to study the processes that are carried out at the cellular level, but are not necessarily restricted to a single cell. For example, cell communication occurs among more than one cell, but occurs at the cellular level.</obo:IAO_0000115>
