        <obo:IAO_0000117 xml:lang="en">Person: Chris Stoeckert, Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119 xml:lang="en">MO_66 IndividualGeneticCharacteristics</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000232 xml:lang="en">MO definition:
The genotype of the individual organism from which the biomaterial was derived. Individual genetic characteristics include polymorphisms, disease alleles, and haplotypes.

examples in ArrayExpress
wild_type
MutaMouse (CD2F1 mice with lambda-gt10LacZ integration)
AlfpCre; SNF5 flox/knockout
p53 knock out
C57Bl/6 gp130lox/lox MLC2vCRE/+
fer-15; fem-1
df/df
pat1-114/pat1-114 ade6-M210/ade6-M216 h+/h+ (cells are diploid)</obo:IAO_0000232>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">genetic characteristics information</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


