        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The production of perforin, an immune mediator molecule involved in T cell degranulation,  resulting from the recognition of a T cell epitope.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Should be linked to a GO process, which will be requested by IEDB team. Along with granzyme B production, should be tied to T cell degranulation</obo:IAO_0000116>
