        <obo:IAO_0000116 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">6/13/11 BP: The disposition referenced is the one of the ligand to bind the molecule. This along with binding as a function / process needs to be figured out with GO which is inconsistent at this point.</obo:IAO_0000116>
