        <obo:IAO_0000112 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The 45 minute period in which one half of the complexes formed by peptide ligand bound to a  HLA-A*0201molecule disassociate.</obo:IAO_0000112>
