        <obo:IAO_0000111 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">purified MHC competitive binding assay measuring equilibrium dissociation constant [KD] of a MHC:ligand complex approximated by IC50 using fluorescence detection</obo:IAO_0000111>
