        <obo:IAO_0000115>An array that consists of 3-micron silica beads that self assemble in microwells on either of two materials: fiber optic bundles or planar silica slides.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>PERSON: Chris Stoeckert, Jie Zheng, Alan Ruttenberg, Venkat Malladi</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://www.illumina.com/technology/beadarray_technology.ilmn</obo:IAO_0000119>
