        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A short oligonucleotide complementary to target DNA (5&apos;-&gt;3&apos; on minus strand) that acts as the leader for DNA extension in a PCR reaction. The polymerase starts replication at the 3&apos;-end of the primer, and copies the opposite strand. A primer is characterized by its &apos;melting temperature&apos; (Tm) and pairs of primers should have similar Tm.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117 xml:lang="en">Philippe Rocca-Serra</obo:IAO_0000117>
