        <obo:IAO_0000114 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000120"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">An ion semiconductor chip manufactured by Life Technologies which detects polymerase-driven base incorporation to translate into digital form. The 318 chip is compatible with the Ion Torrent PGM and has a run time of:

4.4 hours for 200 bp reads with an output of 60 Mb-1 Gb,
