        <obo:IAO_0000115>A human array which is manufacutred by NanoString Technologies. Built upon color-coded molecular barcodes technology, the array profiles miRNA with increased specificity and sensitivty than microarrays.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>PERSON: Venkat Malladi, Chris Stoeckert, Jie Zheng, Alan Ruttenberg.  Mark A. Miller removed &quot;V2&quot; per https://github.com/obi-ontology/obi/issues/831 on 20180511.</obo:IAO_0000117>
