        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An analyte assay that is meant to detect general antibodies that react with substances that are produced by cellular damage caused by Treponema pallidum indicating a syphilis infection. VDRL tests require a microscope and can be done on cerebrospinal fluid as well as blood.</obo:IAO_0000115>
