        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An analyte assay that is meant to detect with the aid of carbon or charcoal particles general antibodies that react with substances that are produced by cellular damage caused by Treponema pallidum indicating a syphilis infection. RPR tests can be done without a microscope.</obo:IAO_0000115>
