        <obo:IAO_0000115>A role borne by a material entity and realized in an assay which achieves the objective to measure the magnitude/concentration/amount of the measurand in the entity bearing evaluant role.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>Person: Alan Ruttenberg, Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
