MHB 3-5-13:  This OBI class was formerly called &apos;immortalized cell line culture&apos;, but label changed and definition updated following CLO alignment work in spring of 2013.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000117 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">PERSON:Matthew Brush</obo:IAO_0000117>
