        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A cell specimen comprised of a mixed cell population obtained by processing whole spleen into individual cells, typically performed using a sieve or blender. This population includes T cells, B cells, macrophages, and other cell types.</obo:IAO_0000115>
