        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Any molecule recognized by the adaptive immune receptors? Recognized means bound with a certain affinity? From GO ag binding:Interacting selectively with an antigen, any substance which is capable of inducing a specific immune response and of reacting with the products of that response, the specific antibody or specifically sensitized T-lymphocytes, or both. Binding may counteract the biological activity of the antigen. see OBI_1110120 below</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117 xml:lang="en">IEDB</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119 xml:lang="en">IEDB</obo:IAO_0000119>
