        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A luminous flux quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer&apos;s emitting longer wavelength light following the absorption of shorter wavelength radiation; fluorescence is common with aromatic compounds with several rings joined together.</obo:IAO_0000115>
