        <obo:IAO_0000114>metadata incomplete</obo:IAO_0000114>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A physical quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer&apos;s participation in movement. [database_cross_reference: PATOC:GVG]</obo:IAO_0000115>
