        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A pathologic primary tumor stage for ovary according to AJCC 7th edition indicating that the tumor involves one or both ovaries with microscopically confirmed peritoneal metastasis outside the pelvis and/or regional lymph node metastasis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
