        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An International Federation of Gynecology and Obstetrics cervical cancer stage value specification indicating invasive carcinoma which can be diagnosed only by microscopy, with deepest invasion &lt;5 mm and the largest extension &lt;7 mm.</obo:IAO_0000115>
